","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5009750-1847286114030111","game_id":"steam-5009750","kind":"announcement","title":"Join the Free Ball Online Multiplayer Playtest!","summary":"This is what y’all have been waiting for. Free Ball is hosting an online multiplayer playtest before the Kickstarter campaign ends!Get your first taste of competitive volleyball with other players before the full release. Just keep in mind that this is an early playtest, so there will be bugs!Sign up for the playtest on the Steam page now so you’re ready to jump in when it begins. Invite up to 3 friends so you can team up and compete together! Don't have friends to play with? Join our growing Fr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T19:29:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030111","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:08:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5009750-1846651706672978","game_id":"steam-5009750","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Ball’s Kickstarter Is LIVE! Limited-Time Full Game Discount & Stretch Goals","summary":"The Free Ball Kickstarter is officially LIVE!The wait is over! The Free Ball Kickstarter campaign is now live, and this is your chance to help bring our vision of a competitive multiplayer volleyball game to life.Backing the project early means more than getting the game at a huge limited-time discount. Your support also helps boost the campaign’s visibility and brings us one step closer to making online multiplayer a reality!Stretch Goals Revealed!Here’s what Free Ball aims to add as the campai","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T02:40:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672978","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5009750-1846018067931143","game_id":"steam-5009750","kind":"announcement","title":"Bringing REMATCH to Free Ball + Kickstarter Launching Next Week!","summary":"People discovering Free Ball keep comparing it to Rematch, but volleyball. That got me thinking: why not take inspiration from Rematch’s AR Stadium concept and bring that idea to Free Ball?New AR-Inspired EnvironmentsTo keep rallies feeling fresh, the environment will change while you're playing. You can take your matches from a traditional volleyball stadium to a stylized medieval fantasy field, an Asian dynasty palace, and more environments currently in the works. This update makes every match","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T19:03:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931143","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5009750-1844751498234894","game_id":"steam-5009750","kind":"announcement","title":"Practice is Now a Full Tutorial + Minor Updates. Kickstarter Launch: 10.10.2026","summary":"Based on feedback from players who were having trouble getting into Free Ball, the Practice mode has been redesigned into a proper Tutorial that you can follow step-by-step.The new tutorial includes guided descriptions and videos covering the basics of Free Ball, including:Float ServingJump ServingReceivingSpikingRoll ShotsSettingBlockingUsing Special AbilitiesThe goal is to make Free Ball easier to understand and pick up, especially for players who may not have much experience with games or vol","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T16:54:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234894","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5009750-1843481262693934","game_id":"steam-5009750","kind":"announcement","title":"Traditional Chinese Localization Now Available｜繁體中文本地化現已推出","summary":"Free Ball is now localized in Traditional Chinese!With the recent increase in Free Ball’s popularity in Taiwan, adding Traditional Chinese support has become an important step in making the game more accessible to local players.A huge thank you to everyone in Taiwan who has been supporting Free Ball and helping the game grow.More languages will be supported in future updates.Free Ball 現已支援繁體中文！隨著 Free Ball 近期在台灣的人氣快速上升，加入繁體中文支援成為讓台灣玩家更容易體驗遊戲的重要一步。非常感謝台灣玩家一直以來對 Free Ball 的支持，也感謝大家幫助遊戲持續成長。未來更新將陸續","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T02:53:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262693934","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5009750-1842846814451682","game_id":"steam-5009750","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Ball is Fully Playable on Steam Deck","summary":"Free Ball is Fully Playable on Steam DeckGood news, Steam Deck players!Free Ball has been tested on Steam Deck and fully works. You can jump into matches, navigate the menus, and play the game using the Steam Deck controls.While there is still room to improve optimization and performance, the game is fully functional on Steam Deck. All in-game UI clearly displays the appropriate Steam Deck buttons, so you’ll always know which controls to use.We’ll continue working on optimization and improving t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T21:33:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451682","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5009750-1842846814443419","game_id":"steam-5009750","kind":"announcement","title":"You Asked. I Delivered: Quick Attacks Are Here!","summary":"You asked for quicks and combination plays. So I followed through.Quicks and combination plays are now in Free Ball! Run Quick Attacks For hitters, jump before the setter touches the ball and the setter will send you a quick set. Be ready, the ball is coming fast.Previously, your character would always jump toward the ball when attacking. Now, when you're running a quick, your character will jump in the direction you're facing, giving you more control over your approach and allowing you to run a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T14:00:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814443419","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5009750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5009750":"2026-10-26T07:14:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5009750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:06Z"},"5009770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:06Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5009750","app_id":5009750,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:16Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_ite